feat: customer dashboard, webhook subscriptions, SEO auto-pages for every hot topic

NEW MODULES:
- lib/customer-dashboard.js: /dashboard/:wallet and /api/dashboard/:wallet
  show public spending history (calls, by-tool breakdown, recent tx, referral
  binding) for any Base wallet address — no login required. Drives retention
  by letting customers see exactly what they've consumed.
- lib/webhook-subscriptions.js: POST /webhooks/subscribe creates HTTPS-targeted
  event subscriptions (settlement.new, settlement.daily, digest.ready,
  reconcile.done). HMAC-signed payloads via per-subscription secret. Verifies
  URL ownership before activating. Rate-limited per email+url dedup.
- lib/seo-auto-pages.js: generates individual HTML landing pages for each of
  the top 10 trending items every time the trending cache refreshes (every
  10 min). Each page has NewsArticle JSON-LD, canonical, og tags, and links
  to related topics. Served from /topic/:slug via express route.

ENDPOINTS ADDED:
- GET /dashboard/:wallet — HTML consumption dashboard (public, no auth)
- GET /api/dashboard/:wallet — JSON API version
- POST /webhooks/subscribe — create subscription (email+url+events)
- GET /webhooks/verify/:id — activate after URL ownership proof
- GET /webhooks/list — list all subscriptions (fingerprints only)
- POST /webhooks/test — test endpoint reachability
- GET /topic/:slug — serve auto-generated SEO landing page per trending item

AUTOMATION ENHANCED:
- After-settle hook now fires BOTH alerts.enqueue AND webhookSubs.deliver
  so both the internal alert system and customer webhooks fire on every payment
- Trending cache refresh now triggers seoPages.generateAllPages(top 10)
  automatically every 10 minutes (idempotent overwrite)

VERIFICATION: extended-prod-smoke 25/25 PASS; crontab unchanged at 13 tasks;
deploy clean with existing data preserved (webhook-subs.json and topic dir
will be created on first use).
